{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person\u00a0speedrunning precision puzzle  platformer set in a somewhat distant future <br>You are an average joe called Bob,\u00a0who is going to fulfill his dream because he has been chosen by the government to become the next agent in order to help everyone <br> <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your personal times and your friends' as well when speedrunning all the levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/af86f5b05315be7f280522f99b5a01c8.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/af86f5b05315be7f280522f99b5a01c8.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/af86f5b05315be7f280522f99b5a01c8.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the movement in order to maintain the most speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13786201eda65dd916f1e09567bfb7d9.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13786201eda65dd916f1e09567bfb7d9.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13786201eda65dd916f1e09567bfb7d9.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your aim with given items so you can eliminate all the various targets across all levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/f9854b13382063e5efc44d226885ab7e.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/f9854b13382063e5efc44d226885ab7e.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/f9854b13382063e5efc44d226885ab7e.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn all the abilities you will acquire throughout the game to create movement enhancing synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13f323ff316ffa91d9150ac146fac8e4.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13f323ff316ffa91d9150ac146fac8e4.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/13f323ff316ffa91d9150ac146fac8e4.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over your path. Create your own one and outsmart everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/9dbc2239b28fa8d34b5c5985a9e7a8ef.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/9dbc2239b28fa8d34b5c5985a9e7a8ef.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/9dbc2239b28fa8d34b5c5985a9e7a8ef.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bob's dream is in your hands, do not fail him. Become the best agent out there</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/8729bf4a20ab92536a8bd02f3c13b0bf.poster.avif?t=1763324247\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/8729bf4a20ab92536a8bd02f3c13b0bf.webm?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/extras/8729bf4a20ab92536a8bd02f3c13b0bf.mp4?t=1763324247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220130?t=1763324247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/34143d2272cc5860427c7c08f0321c49f9a97b8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763324247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/e560719966e78e9306f4fb825c842044b5924613/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763324247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220130/e560719966e78e9306f4fb825c842044b5